`public class JwtFilter extends OncePerRequestFilter {
    @Override
    protected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest req, HttpServletResponse res, FilterChain chain) throws ServletException, IOException {
        String header = req.getHeader("Authorization");
        if (header != null && header.startsWith("Bearer ")) {
            try {
                Claims claims = jwtService.parse(header.substring(7));
                var auth = new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(claims.getSubject(), null, jwtService.roles(claims));
                SecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);
            } catch (JwtException e) {
                // token invalid: leave unauthenticated
            }
        }
        chain.doFilter(req, res);
    }
}`! — register: `.addFilterBefore(new JwtFilter(jwtService), UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter.class)` (!) — never skip signature (jjwt enforces!) (!).

